

### `utils/electionManager.js`
- Core election management system
- Handles creating elections, voting, and results
- Saves election data to JSON file

### `events/MessageReactionAdd.js`
- Handles voting through emoji reactions
- Updates election messages with vote counts
- Validates votes and removes invalid reactions

### `commands/election/create.js`
- `/create-election` slash command
- Creates new elections with title, options, and duration
- Admin only

### `commands/election/end.js`
- `/end-election` slash command
- Manually ends active elections
- Admin only

### `commands/election/results.js`
- `/election-results` slash command
- Shows election results and vote counts
- Public command

### `commands/election/audit.js`
- `/election-audit` slash command
- Generates detailed voting logs as JSON file
- Admin only

### `commands/election/list.js`
- `/list-elections` slash command
- Lists all active elections
- Public command

